  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TPNW Universalization and Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The entry into force of the Treaty on the Prohibition of Nuclear Weapons (TPNW) in 2021 has turned nuclear weapons abolition from a distant dream to a part of international law. The TPNW needs our help! We need to make the treaty universal by getting all countries that haven&apos;t done so to sign it or ratify it. Our particular focus is on implementation of the humanitarian provisions of the treaty, which aim to help victims of nuclear testing and use and to remediate their environments.</narrative>
  </description>
